@	
o	-help|-h	Show help for authchanger	
o	-version	Prints the version number	
o	-print	Prints the current list of authorization mechanisms	
o	-debug	Does a dry run of the changes and prints out what would have happened	
o	-reset	Resets the login screen to the factory settings	
o	-demobilize	Sets up Jamf Connect Login to only demobilze accounts	
o	-notify	Adds the DEP Notify addition to the corresponding -AD, or -Setup argument	
o	-setup	Adds the DEP Notify addition to the corresponding -AD, or -Setup argument	
o	-jamfconnect	Enables Jamf Connect 2.0 login mechanisms	
o	-verbose	Enables verbose logging	
o	-prelogin	Mechs to be used before the actual UI is shown	
o	-preauth	Mechs to be used between the login UI and actual authentication	
o	-postauth	Mechs to be used after system authentication	
o	-customrule	Allows the printout of any authorizationDB rule as well as setting of that rule to any custom…	
o	-sysprefs	Enables Azure authentication for the Network Preference Pane	
o	-sysprefsreset	Removes Azure authentication for the Network Preference Pane	
o	-defaultjcright	Adds the mechanism to be used with the sudosaml binary	
